# KDE Config File
[KDE Desktop Entry]
# KEEP THE LINE ABOVE IN THE FIRST 64 BYTES. kpanel reads only that
# much to decide a file is a menu entry (kdebase/kpanel/pmenu.C:91,
# isKdelnkFile) and skips one that fails, silently - this entry did not
# appear on 86Box until the comments below were moved under it.
#
# vlhe.kdelnk - the VLHE control centre's entry in KDE's Applications >
# Multimedia menu, beside KMix and KsCD. design/54 G12, 2026-10-03.
# The same format as Corel's own KMix.kdelnk; the icons are vlhe.xpm
# (32x32) and mini/vlhe.xpm (16x16) in /usr/X11R6/share/icons.
# vlhe-root.kdelnk runs the same program as root, from Applications >
# System - where Corel puts its own root tools.
#
# Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas Tranter
# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
# Part of VLHE. See LICENSE.TXT for the full license text.
BinaryPattern=vlhe.gtk;
Exec=vlhe.gtk
Path=
Type=Application
Terminal=0
TerminalOptions=
MimeType=
Protocols=
Extensions=
Name=VLHE Control Centre
Comment=Mixer, virtual CD-ROM drives and MIDI synth - Virtual Legacy Hardware Emulation
Icon=vlhe.xpm
MiniIcon=vlhe.xpm
